<!--Layout grid for the 1920x1080 canvas. All geometry in the skin is written in these units, so
    controls line up across windows:
      col_N_begin    x of the left edge of column N (24 columns of 72px, the first at x=96)
      N_col          width of N columns
      N_col_gutter   N columns less a 24px gutter (text inside an N column tile)
      N_col_textbox  N columns less 3px (hairline gap between neighbouring tiles)
      N_col_indent   N columns plus 12px (text starting just right of an N column tile)
      row_N_begin    y of the top of row N (rows of 36px, the first at y=54)
      N_row          height of N rows
    The table is complete on purpose, also where a value is not used yet.-->
